flowchart LR
    R[Agent run] --> W[(Workflow memory)]
    W --> C[Canonicalise into<br/>trajectory classes]
    C --> G{Gates: repeats,<br/>succeeds, varied wording,<br/>confirmed, recent?}
    G -- no --> W
    G -- yes --> D[Distil and validate<br/>a SKILL.md]
    D --> S[Shadow:<br/>stored, not injected]
    S -- a person activates --> A[Active skill]
    A --> I[Injected into<br/>matching turns]
    I --> R
    A --> M{Monitor:<br/>still succeeding?}
    M -- yes --> A
    M -- no --> X[Demoted: raw workflows<br/>recalled again]
    X --> W
